## User preferences

- when the user said “先完整读一遍任务书”, requested A→B2 without waiting, and forbade `frontend/`, `scripts/atlas-update.mjs`, and `kernel/context.py` -> establish the exact boundary/baseline first, execute continuously, and write a result that distinguishes verified from unverified gates. [Task 1]
- when the user said “测试不要膨胀” -> repair import-path regressions only; favor existing diagnostics, compile/import checks, real dialogue, and logs over an invented suite. [Task 1]
